# Claude Code: ignore local-only state + per-machine settings, but allow
# project skills/commands/protocol docs to be tracked. Skills are project
# knowledge (vendor-switch checklist, /go, /end-session, etc.) — they
# should be available to every Claude Code session, not just Petter's
# local machine.
.claude/state/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.*

# MCP publisher and registry tokens (CRIT-S43: previously corrupted as UTF-16)
mcp-publisher.exe
.mcpregistry_github_token
.mcpregistry_registry_token

apps/spike/

# Raw sweep evidence (may embed production output values) stays local
audit-output/*.jsonl
docs/company/ceo-dashboard.html

# Codex-CLI parallel config (AGENTS.md + .agents/ + .codex/) — deliberately
# untracked per the 2026-08-17 Phase 3 decision: the content is ~4 months
# stale vs CLAUDE.md (missing the Shared-Checkout Rule and the August
# decisions) and tracking it stale risks a Codex session operating on wrong
# rules. Track only after a refresh brings it in line with CLAUDE.md.
/AGENTS.md
/.agents/
/.codex/
